@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. A user message in, assistant text out — .user().call().content()
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/basic
Content-Type: text/plain

What is the color of a carrot?

### 2a. Same question, with a fruits-only system prompt — .system() + .user()
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/system
Content-Type: text/plain

What is the color of a carrot?

### 2b. A fruit question fits the system instructions
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/system
Content-Type: text/plain

What is the color of a banana?

### 3a. Substitute a topic into "Tell me a short joke about {topic}."
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/template
Content-Type: text/plain

cows

### 3b. Same template, different parameter value — .text() + .param()
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/template
Content-Type: text/plain

computers
